  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Northern Plains’ Longevity Heaven tremors. Orange-yellow light envelops its sky, and an aura grows from weak to world-filling. Flower Lady, who shares the North Desolation Immortal seat with Bull Demon, giggles that West Desolation Immortal Bing Sai Chuan has awakened. Longevity Heaven keeps Four Desolation Immortals for rank eight Gu Immortals and Eight Extremities for elite rank sevens.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "char_flower_lady",
        "char_north_desolation_immortal",
        "char_bull_demon",
        "char_west_desolation",
        "fac_four_desolations",
        "fac_eight_extremities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A figure walks down a river of rainbow light. He has a tall body and a delicate face, with sharp icy eyes. From his right ear to the left corner of his lips runs an ugly scar that flickers with white light and the coldness of thousand year profound ice. Five Elements Grandmaster recognizes him as the Bing Sai Chuan born in Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s generation, a rank eight legend and time path great expert whom Giant Sun Immortal Venerable tried three times to subdue, now the West Desolation Immortal of Longevity Heaven. Bull Demon and Flower Lady greet him as Senior West Desolation.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He says he is awake but does not have much lifespan, and asks for information of the current world. After hearing of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building’s collapse, Dragon Palace, and Heavenly Court’s Refinement Path Convention, he laughs that Fang Yuan did a great job destroying the building, and says they have to contact Fang Yuan and make an alliance. Using Lang Ya land spirit, he tells Fang Yuan he is West Desolation Immortal, the current leader of Longevity Heaven, and that they should forget past conflicts and resist Heavenly Court together, because repairing fate Gu would help Heavenly Court and go against Ancestor Giant Sun’s luck path. Fang Yuan addresses him as Lord Bing Sai Chuan and proposes they work together to fight for Dragon Palace. He agrees.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "gu_fate_gu",
        "char_immortal_zombie_giant_sun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a tall body and a delicate face. His eyes are extremely sharp and icy. From his right ear to the left corner of his lips runs an ugly scar that flickers with white light and the coldness of thousand year profound ice.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Above the River of Time, when four Heavenly Court time path Immortal Gu Houses encircle Fang Yuan, Fang Yuan shouts for Bing Sai Chuan. Bing Sai Chuan appears behind Present and Past Pavilion, which had not detected him. He pushes with both palms. Cold winds and frost energy seal the house in transparent profound ice, freezing the three Xunzi inside. On Eternal Yacht, Qing Ye names the killer move immediate time freeze and names him the time path great expert of Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s era. Bing Sai Chuan says he is Longevity Heaven’s Bing Sai Chuan, then attacks Qing Ye. With Fang Yuan he suppresses Heavenly Court’s remaining three houses.",
      "chapters": [
        1694
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "time-freeze-counterattack",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "char_qing_ye"
      ]
    }
  ],
